enshot comparison:** Took both screenshots at 1280×900 via headless Chrome. Original renders as an unstyled top-to-bottom text/image dump; my clone renders the same four products as a proper 4-column card grid with correct text, correct badge placement, and no layout overflow. One round of screenshot comparison was sufficient — the componentized version faithfully reflects the underlying data/structure while giving the evidently-intended `product-card`/`badge` classes real visual treatment, so I stopped there rather than iterating further against a source that has no actual visual design to match pixel-for-pixel."
